Subject: New remote work allowance from 1 July

Hi all,

Policy POL-HR-017 v3.0 was approved on 28 May. From 1 July the structural allowance goes from EUR 140 to EUR 151, and we introduce EUR 75 for employees who telework one day a week.
Please note: customers with their own contract terms (for example Janssens Logistics) keep their contractual amount.
The old v2.1 PDF has been removed from the intranet.

